      "text": {
        "hi": "अब उल्टा: ‘says that’ वाले वाक्य को सीधे बोले गए शब्दों में लिखो। उदाहरण: Mala says that she wants to be a doctor. → Mala says, \"I want to be a doctor.\"",
        "hinglish": "Ab ulta: ‘says that’ waale vaakya ko seedhe bole gaye shabdon mein likho. Udaharan: Mala says that she wants to be a doctor. → Mala says, \"I want to be a doctor.\"",
        "en": "Now the other way: write ‘says that’ sentences as the exact spoken words. Example: Mala says that she wants to be a doctor. → Mala says, \"I want to be a doctor.\""
      }
    },
